## Overview

The Knight is a custom class built on a Paladin base. They are a holy bodyguard who
protects one ally at a time through shields and focused healing. They sacrifice AoE
capability and CC for focused single-target protection.

---

## Design Philosophy

### Fantasy

A defensive warrior-priest who protects allies through sacred power. Not a raid
healer - a dedicated protector of one target. Think "the one who stands between
the healer and death."

### Healing Model

**Flash of Light is the ONLY healing spell.**
- No Renew, no Holy Light, no group heals
- Desperate Prayer kept as emergency tank cooldown (exception)
- Smite for holy damage, creates proc synergy with Surge of Light

### Core Gameplay Loop

```
1. Melee until crit
2. Art of War procs -> instant Flash of Light
3. If Flash crits -> Surge of Light procs -> instant Smite (can't crit)
4. Back to melee, wait for next crit
```

### Stat Priority

```
Primary:   Intellect (healing power, mana, crit via talents)
Secondary: Agility (melee crit, Nurturing Instinct healing bonus)
Tertiary:  Strength (damage - nice but droppable)
Ignore:    Spirit

Core scaling: CRIT
  - Crit heals proc Divine Aegis absorbs
  - Crit melee procs Art of War (instant Flash)
  - Crit Flash procs Surge of Light (instant Smite)
```

