## Strengths / Weaknesses

**CAN Do:**
- Single-target healing (Flash of Light only)
- Single-target shielding (Sacred Shield)
- Stat buffs (Blessing of Kings, Horn of Winter, Arcane Intellect)
- Self-armor (Inner Fire)
- Parry-based damage (Reckoning, Counterattack)
- Burst mobility (Sprint)
- Cleanse (Purify - poison + disease)
- Holy damage (Smite)
- Tank threat (Vigilance, Mocking Blow)

**CANNOT Do:**
- AoE damage
- Ranged damage except Smite
- CC (no stuns)
- Group healing
- Magic dispel (Scholar handles that)
- HoTs (Flash is direct heal only)

